#: .\documentation\templates\documentation\docs\customization.html:761
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        The <code class=\"inline-tag\">@layer components</code> block defines reusable CSS classes for buttons, badges, inputs, and more. These classes consume the design tokens.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Der Block <code class=\"inline-tag\">@layer components</code> definiert wiederverwendbare CSS-Klassen für Schaltflächen, Badges, Eingabefelder und mehr. Diese Klassen nutzen die Design-Tokens."

#: .\documentation\templates\documentation\docs\customization.html:768
msgid "Button Variants"
msgstr "Button-Varianten"

#: .\documentation\templates\documentation\docs\customization.html:779
